WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:04,500
These dry goods can be stored on the road and can be exchanged

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:10,050
Now the supplies are more abundant

3
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:15,550
Everyone, hurry up and load up the car, we're ready to go

4
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,690
Take a look

5
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:24,110
It’s great to communicate well

6
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:26,110
Exchange each other's missing items

7
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:30,110
The group of people in front really had to rob them.

8
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:32,400
I thought everyone would ask

9
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:38,470
In fact, even I was seriously injured this time.

10
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:40,470
Only then did I know that my body was really different.

11
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:43,950
If we do this, we will kill people.

12
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:47,140
If those broken dreams in Lingying Camp recently are true,

13
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:50,140
Don't think about it, I'm afraid the world won't get better

14
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:52,140
It will only get worse in the future

15
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:55,140
Water, food, each is more precious than the other

16
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:59,530
The rescuers probably have too much time to take care of themselves and not everyone else.
